Additional notice regarding ERA5 / Copernicus data:

This repository contains modified Copernicus Climate Change Service information.

ERA5 reanalysis data are generated using Copernicus Climate Change Service
information and are subject to the Copernicus licensing terms and attribution
requirements.

Neither the European Commission nor ECMWF is responsible for any use that may
be made of the Copernicus information or data contained herein.

Users must preserve proper attribution to:

- Copernicus Climate Change Service (C3S)
- European Centre for Medium-Range Weather Forecasts (ECMWF)

Official ERA5 source:

https://cds.climate.copernicus.eu/

Official Copernicus licence terms:

https://cds.climate.copernicus.eu/api/v2/terms/static/licence-to-use-copernicus-products.pdf
